{"version":4,"text":"# Harbor Archive Restore R-09: archived results\nDocument status: historical record for a separate earlier workload.\nSynthetic local evidence only.\nR-09 tested an earlier firmware version with a smaller archive. Quill had a median restore latency of 142 seconds and 200 successful restores out of 200 attempts. Sable had a median of 140 seconds and 400 successful restores out of 400 attempts. Both met the R-09 acceptance requirements.\nR-09 does not describe the later Night Restore R-17 workload and cannot replace its signed measurements or its acceptance decision.\n","id":"harbor-4","title":"04-r09-archived-results.md","source":"synthetic:harbor/04-r09-archived-results.md","revision":4,"workspace_id":"6a86b3d7-5f91-48da-9174-7cc1082e249a"}